NEWLCS,	DEVNAME				/MOVE DEVICE NAME
NEWMCS,	OVID+BINBUFFER			/TO HERE
LODLUP,	ISZ	MESSAGE			/BUMP TO NEXT
	TAD I	MESSAGE			/GET A FILE ARGUMENT
	SNA CLA				/SKIP IF VALID
