OBINBUF,BINBUFFER			/TRANSFER ADDRESS
OURFUN,	13^100+.-.			/UNIT BITS WILL BE FILLED IN
OURBLK,	.-.				/BLOCK WILL BE FILLED IN
	TAD I	(CHKCNT+BINBUFFER)	/GET CHECKSUM COUNT
